flowchart TB
    subgraph App["应用作者"]
        Feature["«component» State + Feature 子类型<br/>Input / Operation / RequestHandler 声明"]
        View["«component» View<br/>原生控件与本地接线"]
    end
    subgraph Compile["MiKiNuo.Mvi 包内唯一 analyzer · 仅编译期"]
        Generator["«component» MiKiNuo.Mvi.Generators<br/>输入、命令、Projection、端口与工厂"]
    end
    subgraph Platform["MiKiNuo.Mvi.Avalonia / MiKiNuo.Mvi.Godot"]
        Adapter["«component» 平台 Projection / FeatureHost<br/>输入连接、UI 调度、视图挂载与卸载"]
    end
    subgraph Core["MiKiNuo.Mvi 核心运行时"]
        Runtime["«component» Feature / FeatureStore · 每实例独立<br/>Reduce / RuntimeSnapshot / ExecuteAsync"]
        Mediator["«component» Mediator / RequestPort<br/>定向接纳、等待与处理结果"]
        Ownership["«component» FeatureOwnership / FeatureFactory<br/>所有权、独立 Scope 与关闭票据"]
    end
    Other["«component» 其他独立 Feature"]
    Services["«component» 应用外部服务<br/>HTTP、文件、导航与 UI 服务"]
    Feature -.->|声明输入| Generator
    Generator -.->|生成强类型入口| Feature
    View -->|本地绑定与原生信号| Adapter
    Adapter -->|生成输入与操作调用| Runtime
    Runtime -->|门内纯规则 / 门外 Operation| Feature
    Feature -->|异步业务调用| Services
    Runtime <-->|明确契约端口| Mediator
    Other <-->|定向请求 / Post| Mediator
    Ownership -->|所有权与关闭| Runtime
